@startuml
title Deployment State Machine
[*] --> PLANNING : Create deployment [MS-01]
PLANNING --> PROVISIONING : Plan persisted and validated [MS-08..MS-09]
PROVISIONING --> DEPLOYING : Resource batches READY [MS-10]
DEPLOYING --> SUCCEEDED : Workloads READY + final transaction [MS-12]
PLANNING --> FAILED : planning error
PROVISIONING --> FAILED : executor error
DEPLOYING --> FAILED : render/apply/readiness error
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
note right of FAILED
  Status recording only.
  Retry/resume/rollback are out of scope.
end note
@enduml
